{"asset_key":"timeline/quest_story_12244100","episode":"timeline","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12244100","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"cinematic_dialogue:2:1224409001:":{"text":"……被告人テシオは海のギャングと結託して、アクアラ村のユーリ、ホスら複数人を殺害し……","source_cn":"……泰西欧勾结水鬼，出卖血薇帮，还害死小水村的尤里、霍斯……等人","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5CA8B4E429C8A1E2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:2:1224409002:":{"text":"――以上のように明確な証拠があり、テシオの行為はいかなる理由があっても許されない。","source_cn":"——综上所述，证据确凿，泰西欧罪无可恕","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF0CA3A624DA50377","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:2:1224409003:":{"text":"ラスティーアンカーの公安条例に則り、テシオを死刑に処する！","source_cn":"按照锈锚港治安条例，泰西欧判处死刑！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD734D1BF0B13F7C0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:5:1224410001:0":{"text":"テシオが連れて行かれた後……","source_cn":"泰西欧被押走后……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4E97C00B2D44C4A7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1224410002:0":{"text":"テシオめ！さっさと死んじまえ！","source_cn":"泰西欧！早就该死了！呸！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFB7B22B6C4B93624","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"",